5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am tired of calculating the cost of warmth before I even turn the dial.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,The monthly reconciliation is eating my evenings. I need to know how much time this actually takes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The current split was for three people. It feels arbitrary now that we are five.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to see the full year's data before I agree to any new structure.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I worry that arguing about money is making us distant. I want to fix that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, if we don't look at the winter peaks, we will be blindsided again.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Jonathan, I agree. The workload is the real issue, not just the math.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, yes. I want to verify if the current split is actually fair.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, I am concerned about the upfront costs of changing the system.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, I hope we can find a way that doesn't cause more tension.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the plug-in monitor readings to see who uses what.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will look at the monthly settle observed at another house.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will review the last twelve utility statements to see the variance.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the electrician's quote for the rooms.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look at the payment log for the last twelve months.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Also, I will check the sunlight and heating need by room.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,And I will try the reconciliation template to see the effort involved.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the settling up when the last rooms filled.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
