35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The monitor shows one room uses four times more than the others. That is a huge gap.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,The other house spent forty minutes just logging readings. That is a lot of time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The statements show February was 29,400 yen, but August was only 9,100. The swing is massive.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The electrician quoted 34,000 yen per room for meters. That is a significant upfront cost.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The payment log shows three late payments, all after arguments. The tension is real.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, that seasonal swing explains why the flat share feels unfair in winter.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, 34,000 yen per room is steep. Is it worth it to avoid the monthly hassle?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, yes. The variance is too high for a simple split.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, I am hesitant. The upfront cost is high, but the winter bills are painful.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, if it takes forty minutes, maybe we can automate it?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The south rooms stay warm naturally. The north ones need heat from November.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,The template trial meant keying in every invoice manually. It is tedious.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"When the last rooms filled, it took three weeks to agree on the split.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"At the other house, they just left the heater on. They didn't worry about the cost.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,The cooler notice stayed up all summer. People avoided using it to avoid arguments.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, if we pay a fixed rate, we might stop worrying about every switch.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, but who does the annual reconciliation? It is a lot of work.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, the work is the problem. We need a system that minimizes it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Jonathan, I see the logic. But the upfront cost for meters is high.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I think fairness is more important than the upfront cost.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
